<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL Finance 5.0 pct bonds due 2004 AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL Finance 5.0 pct bonds due 2004 AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Tuesday it had assigned an AAA rating to the 1.0 billion mark 5.0 percent bonds due 2004 issued by DSL Finance and guaranteed by Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank (DSL Bank).</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL-bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
